{"comment": "alice challenges bob to liar's dice and bob accepts. Every cup is rolled from the game's random seed, so the dice are placeholders; a reused placeholder must take the same value, so the reveal shows exactly the dice each player saw alone. p1, the challenger, opens round 1."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 1, "type": "auth.login", "body": {"v": 1, "username": "alice", "password": "correct horse"}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 1, "type": "ok", "body": {"user": "alice", "heartbeat_ms": 15000}}}
{"client": "bob", "send": {"id": 1, "type": "auth.login", "body": {"v": 1, "username": "bob", "password": "correct horse"}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"id": 1, "type": "ok", "body": {"user": "bob", "heartbeat_ms": 15000}}}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 2, "type": "challenge.create", "body": {"to": ["bob"], "game": "liars_dice", "options": {}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 2, "type": "ok", "body": {"challenge_id": "$challenge"}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "challenge.changed", "body": {"challenge_id": "$challenge", "from": "alice", "to": ["bob"], "accepted": [], "game": "liars_dice", "options": {}, "state": "pending", "by": null, "game_id": null, "expires_at": "$expires_at"}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"type": "challenge.changed", "body": {"challenge_id": "$challenge", "from": "alice", "to": ["bob"], "accepted": [], "game": "liars_dice", "options": {}, "state": "pending", "by": null, "game_id": null, "expires_at": "$expires_at"}}}
{"client": "bob", "send": {"id": 2, "type": "challenge.accept", "body": {"challenge_id": "$challenge"}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"id": 2, "type": "ok", "body": {}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "challenge.changed", "body": {"challenge_id": "$challenge", "from": "alice", "to": ["bob"], "accepted": ["bob"], "game": "liars_dice", "options": {}, "state": "accepted", "by": null, "game_id": "$game", "expires_at": "$expires_at"}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"type": "challenge.changed", "body": {"challenge_id": "$challenge", "from": "alice", "to": ["bob"], "accepted": ["bob"], "game": "liars_dice", "options": {}, "state": "accepted", "by": null, "game_id": "$game", "expires_at": "$expires_at"}}}
{"comment": "Each player sees only its own five dice, and the other cup as a count. The seat to act is given, for each face it may bid, the least quantity; the opening bid may not be on ones. The other seat gets []."}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "liars_dice", "options": {}, "seq": 0, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}, {"user": "bob", "seat": "p2"}], "to_act": ["alice"], "result": null, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": ["resign", "abort"], "events": [], "view": {"round": 1, "seats": [{"seat": "p1", "dice": 5, "out": false}, {"seat": "p2", "dice": 5, "out": false}], "bid": null, "total_dice": 10, "my_dice": "$alice_dice", "min_bids": [{"face": 2, "quantity": 1}, {"face": 3, "quantity": 1}, {"face": 4, "quantity": 1}, {"face": 5, "quantity": 1}, {"face": 6, "quantity": 1}], "can_dudo": false, "last_reveal": null}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": null, "summary": null, "digest": null, "exports": null}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "liars_dice", "options": {}, "seq": 0, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}, {"user": "bob", "seat": "p2"}], "to_act": ["alice"], "result": null, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": ["resign", "abort"], "events": [], "view": {"round": 1, "seats": [{"seat": "p1", "dice": 5, "out": false}, {"seat": "p2", "dice": 5, "out": false}], "bid": null, "total_dice": 10, "my_dice": "$bob_dice", "min_bids": [], "can_dudo": false, "last_reveal": null}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": null, "summary": null, "digest": null, "exports": null}}}
{"comment": "Out of turn is not_your_turn; with no bid there is nothing to challenge; ones may not open."}
{"client": "bob", "send": {"id": 3, "type": "game.act", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 0, "action": {"kind": "bid", "bid": "1x2"}}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"id": 3, "type": "error", "body": {"code": "not_your_turn", "message": "not your turn"}}}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 3, "type": "game.act", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 0, "action": {"kind": "dudo"}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 3, "type": "error", "body": {"code": "illegal_action", "message": "there is no bid to challenge: open the bidding"}}}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 4, "type": "game.act", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 0, "action": {"kind": "bid", "bid": "1x1"}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 4, "type": "error", "body": {"code": "illegal_action", "message": "the opening bid cannot be on ones"}}}
{"comment": "A bid is quantity x face as text. After 2x3: a higher face keeps the quantity, the same or a lower face needs one more, and ones, which are wild, need half rounded up."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 5, "type": "game.act", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 0, "action": {"kind": "bid", "bid": "2x3"}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "liars_dice", "options": {}, "seq": 1, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}, {"user": "bob", "seat": "p2"}], "to_act": ["bob"], "result": null, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": ["resign", "abort"], "events": [{"by": "p1", "face": 3, "kind": "bid", "quantity": 2}], "view": {"round": 1, "seats": [{"seat": "p1", "dice": 5, "out": false}, {"seat": "p2", "dice": 5, "out": false}], "bid": {"by": "p1", "quantity": 2, "face": 3}, "total_dice": 10, "my_dice": "$alice_dice", "min_bids": [], "can_dudo": false, "last_reveal": null}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": null, "summary": null, "digest": null, "exports": null}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 5, "type": "ok", "body": {"seq": 1}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "liars_dice", "options": {}, "seq": 1, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}, {"user": "bob", "seat": "p2"}], "to_act": ["bob"], "result": null, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": ["resign", "abort"], "events": [{"by": "p1", "face": 3, "kind": "bid", "quantity": 2}], "view": {"round": 1, "seats": [{"seat": "p1", "dice": 5, "out": false}, {"seat": "p2", "dice": 5, "out": false}], "bid": {"by": "p1", "quantity": 2, "face": 3}, "total_dice": 10, "my_dice": "$bob_dice", "min_bids": [{"face": 1, "quantity": 1}, {"face": 2, "quantity": 3}, {"face": 3, "quantity": 3}, {"face": 4, "quantity": 2}, {"face": 5, "quantity": 2}, {"face": 6, "quantity": 2}], "can_dudo": true, "last_reveal": null}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": null, "summary": null, "digest": null, "exports": null}}}
{"comment": "bob calls dudo. Both cups are revealed; threes and ones count. Fewer than 2 loses alice a die, otherwise bob loses one. The loser opens round 2 with every cup rerolled, so who that is and the dice are placeholders."}
{"client": "bob", "send": {"id": 4, "type": "game.act", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 1, "action": {"kind": "dudo"}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "liars_dice", "options": {}, "seq": 2, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}, {"user": "bob", "seat": "p2"}], "to_act": ["$opener"], "result": null, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": ["resign"], "events": [{"bid": {"by": "p1", "quantity": 2, "face": 3}, "by": "p2", "counted": "$counted", "cups": [{"seat": "p1", "dice": "$alice_dice"}, {"seat": "p2", "dice": "$bob_dice"}], "kind": "challenged", "loser": "$loser"}], "view": {"round": 2, "seats": [{"seat": "p1", "dice": "$p1_left", "out": false}, {"seat": "p2", "dice": "$p2_left", "out": false}], "bid": null, "total_dice": 9, "my_dice": "$alice_dice2", "min_bids": "$alice_min_bids2", "can_dudo": false, "last_reveal": {"round": 1, "bid": {"by": "p1", "quantity": 2, "face": 3}, "challenger": "p2", "counted": "$counted", "loser": "$loser", "cups": [{"seat": "p1", "dice": "$alice_dice"}, {"seat": "p2", "dice": "$bob_dice"}]}}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": null, "summary": null, "digest": null, "exports": null}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"type": "game.update", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "game": "liars_dice", "options": {}, "seq": 2, "players": [{"user": "alice", "seat": "p1"}, {"user": "bob", "seat": "p2"}], "to_act": ["$opener"], "result": null, "clock": null, "draw_agreed": [], "controls": ["resign"], "events": [{"bid": {"by": "p1", "quantity": 2, "face": 3}, "by": "p2", "counted": "$counted", "cups": [{"seat": "p1", "dice": "$alice_dice"}, {"seat": "p2", "dice": "$bob_dice"}], "kind": "challenged", "loser": "$loser"}], "view": {"round": 2, "seats": [{"seat": "p1", "dice": "$p1_left", "out": false}, {"seat": "p2", "dice": "$p2_left", "out": false}], "bid": null, "total_dice": 9, "my_dice": "$bob_dice2", "min_bids": "$bob_min_bids2", "can_dudo": false, "last_reveal": {"round": 1, "bid": {"by": "p1", "quantity": 2, "face": 3}, "challenger": "p2", "counted": "$counted", "loser": "$loser", "cups": [{"seat": "p1", "dice": "$alice_dice"}, {"seat": "p2", "dice": "$bob_dice"}]}}, "started_at": "$started_at", "finished_at": null, "summary": null, "digest": null, "exports": null}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"id": 4, "type": "ok", "body": {"seq": 2}}}
{"comment": "bob resigns: his dice leave the table, so alice is the last player with dice and wins."}
{"client": "bob", "send": {"id": 5, "type": "game.control", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 2, "control": "resign"}}}
